---
description: Tailwind styling and CSS theme system
globs: **/*.{tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use Tailwind utility classes; merge conditionally with `cn()` from `@yc/ui`.
- Colors via CSS variables — use tokens like `text-text`, `bg-bg-1`, `bg-accent-1`; no hardcoded hex in components.
- Theme switching: hidden radio inputs (`#theme-system`, `#theme-light`, `#theme-dark`) + CSS `:has()` selectors.
- Shared theme variables and Tailwind registration live in `packages/ui/src/styles/theme.css`.
- Each app's `src/styles/globals.css` imports `tailwindcss`, then `@yc/ui/styles/theme.css`, and declares `@source '../../../../packages/ui/src'` so Tailwind v4 scans the shared package. App-specific chrome stays in that file.
